From f540cd896bb4b97301dba7d3e33c7edb6b11c551 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Li Jinpei <jinpli@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:39:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [MachineLICM] Precommit llvm.licm.disable tests (NFC)

MachineLICM currently ignores llvm.licm.disable and hoists the loop
invariant S_MOV_B32 out of every loop, both before and after register
allocation.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
